   "source": [
    "# Music Annotation Project V7.9.2: Read-Only Deterministic Gate Calibration\n",
    "\n",
    "**Runtime:** CPU. Select **Runtime > Run all**.\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook does not reconstruct or inpaint pages. It reads the saved V7.9.1 NPZ arrays for frozen V7.8 and the connected-dark challenger, rebuilds one predictor/delta row per retained V7.5 mask component, evaluates deterministic fallback gates with page-grouped validation, and exports a frozen gate specification.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Firewall\n",
    "\n",
    "- Predictor fields use observed pages, V7.5 masks/routing arrays and saved challenger routing arrays only.\n",
    "- Clean truth and reconstruction metrics are created after predictors and used only as calibration outcomes.\n",
    "- Raw page coordinates are identifiers, never gate predictors.\n",
    "- The selected gate is retrospective development evidence, not production authorisation.\n",
    "- Frozen V7.8 independent data is prohibited.\n",
    "- Notebook 09 is not read or modified.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
